Description: A user-friendly Shiny-based graphical interface for mass spectrometry 
    imaging (MSI) data analysis using the Cardinal 3 package. Cardinal NEST provides 
    visual workflows for data import, preprocessing, visualization, and statistical 
    analysis without requiring R programming expertise.
